# Mobile uploads and file pickers

Tavelo uploads use **upload-intent → PUT to presigned URL → complete**. On native devices, URI handling is fragile; follow these rules so Android Expo Go does not break.

## Single upload pipeline

- Put all presigned **PUT** logic in `mobile/src/services/storageUpload.ts` (`putLocalFileToSignedUrl`, `stageLocalFileForUpload`, `resolveLocalByteSize`).
- Do **not** use `fetch(localUri).blob()` on iOS/Android for uploads — it often sends an empty body for `content://` and some `file://` URIs.
- Use **`expo-file-system` `File.upload()`** (binary PUT) on native after staging; web stays on `fetch` + blob.

## Staging before any async gap

- Copy picker URIs into app cache (`tavelo-upload-*`) **immediately** after pick, and again at upload time if the URI is not already staged.
- Never assume a picker `file://` path stays readable after `await apiRequest(...)` (upload-intent round trip).

## Which picker to use

| Content | Picker | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Gallery photos / videos | `expo-image-picker` | Same pattern as trip memories and avatars. |
| PDFs and arbitrary files | `expo-document-picker` | On **Android**, set `copyToCacheDirectory: false` and stage via `content://` + `copyPickerUriToDest` fallbacks. |
| Booking attachments UI | `promptBookingAttachmentSource` | Offer **Photo library** vs **PDF or file** — do not rely on document picker alone for JPEGs on Android. |

## MIME and backend complete step

- Normalize client MIME in `mobile/src/lib/mimeTypes.ts` before upload-intent (`image/jpg` → `image/jpeg`, infer from filename when needed).
- Backend **complete** must use `resolveStoredContentType` in `backend/src/modules/storage/policy.ts` when Supabase reports `application/octet-stream`.

## Before merging upload or picker changes

1. Test on **physical Android Expo Go** (not Chrome): pick → upload → complete returns 201 in backend logs.
2. Confirm Metro shows no `[Tavelo]` error; backend shows intent 201 then complete 201.
3. Run `npm run typecheck --prefix mobile`.

See `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md` — **Mobile file picks and storage uploads**.
